  "notes": [
    "Modbus RTU, functions 03 and 06; 9600 8N1, address 1 by default (1 to 240), detection cycle 500 ms. A forgotten address can be read at the special address 250 (FA 03 00 06 00 01 71 80).",
    "Addresses are as in the manual's register list, counted from 0. The baud rate (register 7) is a code, not the speed.",
    "Register 5 is reserved.",
    "Written from the manufacturer's datasheet; not tested on a device."
  ],
